98 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 59 0 R
/E (The system supports multiple buffers such as A and B . Producers insert items into buffers while consumers remove items. Some consumers also forward processed items into another buffer, creating pipeline stages. )
/Pg 14 0 R
